{"id":"109-14","year":109,"num":14,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/109/109_Q14.png","answer":"C","codes":["N-7-9"],"perf":["n-IV-4"],"book":"B2","chapter":"第3章 比與比例式","topic":"百分率連乘","difficulty":"中",
 "solution":"公告前會員價 0.85x；公告後售價漲 10% 再打九折：1.1x×0.9=0.99x。相差 0.99x−0.85x=0.14x。選 (C)。",
